{"id": "70416", "title": "日在校园", "author": "冈田留奈", "category": "都市言情", "count": 2, "available": 2, "cover": "files/article/image/70/70416/70416s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70416.htm", "intro": "不自觉竟看呆了。她那双有着浓密睫毛的艳丽眼眸、形状优美的嘴唇、随风飘飞如绢丝般的长发、如梦似幻的雪白肌肤。", "base": "files/article/html/70/70416", "chapters": [{"title": "[世界篇]", "file": "10959369.html", "available": true}, {"title": "言叶篇", "file": "10959370.html", "available": true}]}